    "result": "Re-inspected the nine structured-sdk-server source paths at OpenCode v1.18.25 commit cb7d8b2f5e44876ef98b661dc10590c915af3a9f and the complete four-commit downstream diff through 6883ca5bd35a5494fb2759018373308911c79e01. The serve command still resolves the requested listener address, password-backed Basic authentication remains explicit, and the server reports its resolved host and port. The v2 client retains directory routing plus health, session creation, typed prompt, structured assistant response, and abort operations. Session schemas still persist JSON-schema output formats and structured assistant values. The downstream changes remain limited to schema validation, bounded structured-output retry and forced finalization, persisted output-format encoding, and preserving the public plugin compatibility version. This change only advances the application release identity to 0.1.1 and updates release-identity tests and installation documentation; it does not alter the OpenCode runtime selection, transport, authentication, cancellation, schema, or permission boundaries.",
